    "updated_at": "2026-09-30T03:22:52Z",
    "body": "IMO we can view this PR as a bug fix that doesn't affect current implementations. But there should be bugs filed about supporting the `close` event. If more time passes and still nobody supports the `close` event, it should be dropped. I believe @asutherland had some interest in supporting `close`.",
