    "updated_at": "2026-09-30T12:19:17Z",
    "body": "We should just remove this event from the specification until we have a design we are satisfied with. I raised this in 2024 https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1766#issuecomment-1994090823 and nobody resolved the new issue so I'm not sure why we keep pretending this is good.",
